McpWebSearchService_1_0_0_Info.terms:
MCP = Model Context Protocol; SearXNG = privacy-respecting meta-search engine;
AOT = Ahead-of-Time native compilation; stdio = JSON-RPC over standard streams;
DTO = Data Transfer Object; JsonSerializerContext = System.Text.Json source-generator for AOT;
Options pattern = IOptions<T> strongly-typed config binding; EnableConfigurationBindingGenerator = AOT-safe source generator replacing reflection-based configuration binder (ADR-006);
ValidateOnStart = deterministic startup validation of IOptions<T>
